    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d153-a9-a3">

                <pb facs="0319" n="973" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg973"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monterey</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-09-12"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 12,
                        1874</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Let the present information be delivered to the citizen Toribio Lozano, as
                    ordered on the 6th of August last; and let the copy requested by him, on the 7th
                    day of the same month, now be delivered to him by the secretary. The citizen
                    district judge of the State of Nuevo Leon so decreed and signed before me, the
                    secretary. I certify.</p>
                <p>The licentiate.</p>
                <closer><signed>VALDEZ GOMEZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pablo Borrego</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Secretary.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
